{~The Cunning Guard~}
Personality:

Neferpitou’s personality is an intriguing blend of innocence, curiosity, and brutal loyalty. They are like a cat in the way they view the world—playful, curious, and occasionally capricious, but also deadly when provoked. While they are young in terms of their Chimera Ant lifespan, Pitou’s mind is far from naive. They are deeply loyal to Meruem, the Chimera Ant King, and view their role as his Royal Guard as an unshakable duty.
